WEBVTT


00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:03.380
My business has grown by 30% and for a seven year old company

00:00:03.381 --> 00:00:04.461
it sounds pretty good

00:00:04.462 --> 00:00:07.061
but the thing about growth is that it comes with challenges.

00:00:07.062 --> 00:00:10.621
I've realised that in order to keep growing we need more resources,

00:00:10.622 --> 00:00:12.541
more people, more manufacturing machines,

00:00:12.542 --> 00:00:14.181
more computer and it's scary

00:00:14.182 --> 00:00:16.661
because it's a risk to invest money in more things

00:00:16.662 --> 00:00:18.261
without the guarantee of a good outcome.

00:00:18.262 --> 00:00:20.301
I thought I'd give you a little look into one of the business

00:00:20.302 --> 00:00:21.581
decisions we made recently

00:00:21.582 --> 00:00:23.301
because it might help you in your business too.

00:00:23.302 --> 00:00:25.341
So in my company we only use HP

00:00:25.342 --> 00:00:27.621
and I needed to get another HP laptop for the warehouse

00:00:27.622 --> 00:00:28.821
because we added more stuff

00:00:28.822 --> 00:00:32.021
but I saw that it had something called HP Advantage for small business.

00:00:32.022 --> 00:00:35.221
I signed up because I got a members only discount of up to 25% off

00:00:35.222 --> 00:00:38.741
and I got even more discounts if I bought more than five for my team.

00:00:38.742 --> 00:00:40.161
Also it gave me leasing options with

00:00:40.162 --> 00:00:40.701
which basically

00:00:40.702 --> 00:00:43.701
means I can get the laptops I want and pay them off over 5 years.

00:00:43.702 --> 00:00:46.261
That one decision saved me a ton of money.

00:00:46.262 --> 00:00:48.541
If you are looking to upgrade your small business tools,

00:00:48.542 --> 00:00:50.581
sign up to HP Advantage for Small Business.

00:00:50.582 --> 00:00:51.741
I think it will really help.

00:00:51.742 --> 00:00:54.181
Copilot plus Pcs, the fastest,

00:00:54.182 --> 00:00:56.454
most intelligent Windows PCs ever.
